%% ACTIRA — Authentication flow
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant UI as SPA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as MongoDB

  U->>UI: Submit credentials
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>DB: find user + verify bcrypt
  alt lockout / bad password
    API-->>UI: 401
  else success
    API->>API: create JWT
    API-->>UI: Set-Cookie httpOnly + body token optional
  end
  UI->>API: GET /api/incidents (cookie)
  API->>API: decode JWT + optional role rebind
  API->>DB: load user role
  API-->>UI: 200 or 401/403
